<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovakia cancels SKK 5bln bond issue for motorways.</title>
<headline>Slovakia cancels SKK 5bln bond issue for motorways.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia has cancelled plans to finance a motorway construction project through a five billion crown bond issue, Finance Minister Sergej Kozlik said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We reconsidered financing some infrastructure projects and we decided not to issue bonds worth five billion crowns planned for motorway construction,&quot; Kozlik told a new conference.</p>
<p>Kozlik said the government would now seek other non-budget sources to finance infrastructure projects including possible foreign loans with state guarantees.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
